<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Salesforce Invoice Email Template</title></head><body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'SF Pro', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;"><table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="font-family: 'SF Pro', Arial, sans-serif;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding: 20px;"><table width="977" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 977px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dddddd;"><tr><td><div style="height: 6px; background: #1a7f5a;"></div><div style="height: 5px; background: #defaf7;"></div><table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#defaf7"><tr><td style="padding: 0 35px;"><table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td width="138" valign="middle" style="width: 138px; padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px;"><img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Salesforce.com_logo.svg/512px-Salesforce.com_logo.svg.png" alt="Salesforce.com logo" width="110" style="width: 110px; display: block;"></td><td valign="middle" align="center" style="padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px;"><h1 style="font-family: 'SF Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 36px; color: #1a365d; text-align: center; margin: 0;">Review and Settle Your Latest Invoice</h1></td><td width="138" style="width: 138px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding: 35px 35px 45px 35px; background: #ffffff;"><p style="font-family: 'SF Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; color: #000000; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 28px;">Hello, {{{Recipient.Name}}},</p><p style="font-family: 'SF Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 28px; color: #333333; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 36px;">Thank you for your business with us. Your latest invoice is available for review and payment. Use the Review and Pay button to login and review invoice details, manage payment methods, and pay the outstanding balance of {{{Invoice.Balance}}} by {{{Invoice.DueDate}}}.</p><table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width: 913px; border: 1px solid #defaf7; border-radius: 8px; background: #defaf7; margin-bottom: 24px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 158, 219, 0.08);"><tr><td style="padding: 24px 25px;"><h3 style="font-family: 'SF Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 28px; color: #1a365d; margin: 0 0 18px 0;">Invoice Details</h3><div style="width: 100%; height: 1px; background-color: #1a7f5a; margin-bottom: 18px;"></div><table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td width="170" style="font-family: 'SF Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 20px; color: #555555; padding-bottom: 18px;">Document Number</td><td style="font-family: 'SF Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 22px; color: #000000; padding-bottom: 18px;">{{{Invoice.DocumentNumber}}}</td></tr><tr><td width="170" style="font-family: 'SF Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 20px; color: #555555; padding-bottom: 18px;">Balance</td><td style="font-family: 'SF Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 22px; color: #000000; padding-bottom: 18px;">{{{Invoice.Balance}}}</td></tr><tr><td width="170" style="font-family: 'SF Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 20px; color: #555555;">Due Date</td><td style="font-family: 'SF Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 22px; color: #000000;">{{{Invoice.DueDate}}}</td></tr></table></td></tr></table><div style="margin-bottom: 36px; margin-top: -8px;"><span style="font-family: 'SF Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a365d; vertical-align: middle;">{{{Invoice.Balance}}}</span><a href="#" target="_blank" style="display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-left: 18px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; background: #1a7f5a; color: #ffffff; border-radius: 26px; height: 44px; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; font-family: 'SF Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 44px; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(26, 127, 90, 0.12);">Review and Pay</a></div><p style="font-family: 'SF Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; color: #333333; margin: 0 0 18px 0;">Contact our support team for any billing or payment inquiries.</p><br><p style="font-family: 'SF Pro', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 26px; color: #000000; margin: 0;">Thank you,<br><strong>{{{Organization.Name}}}</strong></p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>